# Data Paths

External datasets are read-only: `/share/workspace2/moto_imagination/WBCIC_SHU` and `/share/workspace2/moto_imagination/SHU`. Never create, modify, rename, or delete files there.

All runnable configs live under `code/configs/`. WBCIC processed data use the external manifest; SHU raw EDF/MAT/events are indexed read-only. New processed outputs must be written inside this project unless the user explicitly approves another safe output path.
